uota.\n- Given the drafted content, when technical review completes, then the\n  documentation has been technically reviewed against the implemented\n  runtimes and quota configuration, with the review sign-off recorded.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-4 (P2)** — full coverage: documentation states supported AMD\n  hardware, driver prerequisites, and the validated model list.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41114,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a6a655ed610a647","agent_id":"a87fa06e82bd33954","session_id":"9503e158-5f16-4bd9-b154-1147d771dd9b","uuid":"e9d7eabf-1de5-4cb8-a51b-b7f49ee72215","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:34:30.938Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020"}
